abstract: >-
  An interactive model of an evaporating black hole as a qubit system (v1-v9, browser)
  and a headless state-vector engine (v10, Python) for a preregistered test of
  filtered unhooking: whether matter that decouples layer by layer leaves more than
  one turn in the radiation's mutual information D(k).
keywords:
  - black hole information
  - Page curve
  - scrambling
  - Hayden-Preskill
  - qubit model
